response.ok                  | Indicates successful HTTP response
!response.ok                 | Indicates unsuccessful response
response.json()              | Converts response into JSON
data.message                 | Gets image URL from JSON response
setImageUrl(dogImageUrl)     | Stores image URL and causes re-render
catch(error)                 | Handles errors
setError(...)                | Stores friendly error message
finally                      | Runs after success or failure
setLoading(false)            | Stops loading

UI Logic
Code                              | Explanation
----------------------------------|--------------------------------------------
onClick={getRandomDog}            | Calls API function on button click
disabled={loading}                | Disables button while loading
loading ? 'Loading...' : ...      | Changes button text based on loading
error && <p>...</p>               | Shows error only when error exists
imageUrl && <img ... />           | Shows image only when URL exists
src={imageUrl}                    | Uses API image URL dynamically


