TRY / CATCH / FINALLY

================================================================================

Block   | Purpose
--------|-------------------------------------------------
try     | Runs code that may fail
catch   | Handles errors
finally | Always runs whether operation succeeds or fails


Example:

try {

  // API request

} catch (error) {

  // Handle error

} finally {

  // Always runs
}


In this application:

try
→ Fetch and process API response

catch
→ Handle API/request error

finally
→ Always call setLoading(false)


