================================================================================

Issue 1: Image Not Displaying
Possible Cause          | Solution
------------------------|-------------------------------------
imageUrl is empty       | Log imageUrl and check its value
API call failed         | Check browser console for errors
Image URL is incorrect  | Verify data.message
API returns no data     | Log complete API response
Network issue           | Check browser Network tab


