================================================================================

Issue 2: Button Stays in Loading State

================================================================================

Possible Cause                | Solution
------------------------------|----------------------------------------
setLoading(false) not called  | Put setLoading(false) inside finally
Error is not caught           | Use try/catch/finally
API request never completes   | Check API endpoint/network
Runtime error                 | Check browser console


Recommended structure:

try {

  // API call

} catch (error) {

  // Handle error

} finally {

  setLoading(false);
}


================================================================================

Issue 3: Multiple Images / Requests Loading

================================================================================

Possible Cause          | Solution
------------------------|------------------------------------------
Button clicked multiple | Add disabled={loading}
No disabled state       | Disable button while request is running
Multiple fetch requests | Prevent repeated clicks while loading
No user feedback        | Display "Loading..." message


Example:

<button
  onClick={getRandomDog}
  disabled={loading}
>
  {loading ? 'Loading...' : 'Get Random Puppy'}
</button>


